00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:59.480
But it was an arcade game made in 1987 using the same name, Touchdown Fever.

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:06.940
It was then ported to the Famicom in 1988, a year later, as Touchdown Fever American Football.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:10.080
So, they do make that distinction over there.

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:18.460
And then it finally reaches the NES in February of 1991, where it's probably, like, you know, too late.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.420
We've seen a lot.

