00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:10.520
So, you know, it was just never really a good time for SNK.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:17.360
They came too late to the party because if they would have came earlier, they could have competed against 10-yard fight gracefully.

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:30.880
